    {
      "abstract": "The signal polarizations extracted according to the restricted invariant-mass method as a function of $\\phi_\\Lambda - \\phi_p^*$, for positive-rapidity $\\Lambda$ hyperons. The sinusoidal behavior is driven by non-zero net $v_1$. The vertical shift corresponds to the vorticity-driven polarization; in collider mode, where the net $v_1$ is zero, this dependence on $\\phi_\\Lambda - \\phi_p^*$ does not exist.",
